---
import { withBasePath } from "../lib/paths";

const target = withBasePath("/articles/");
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content={`0;url=${target}`} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={target} />
    <title>正在前往文章归档 | N=1 Lab</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>资料模块已归入文章来源，正在前往<a href={target}>文章归档</a>。</p>
    <script define:vars={{ target }}>window.location.replace(target);</script>
  </body>
</html>
